public,"Northern Lights Adventure",,"Iceland","Reykjavík","Reykjavík","Nature,Adventure",2500,false,"Experience the magical Northern Lights in Iceland's pristine wilderness. Visit geysers, glaciers, and thermal lagoons while hunting for the Aurora Borealis.",,Input Number,1,"Arrival in Reykjavík",,"Arrive at Keflavík Airport and take the Flybus to Reykjavík city center. Check into your hotel and explore the charming downtown area. Visit Hallgrímskirkja church and enjoy dinner at a traditional Icelandic restaurant.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Hallgrímskirkja+Reykjavík",Walk,false,,,"Evening Stroll",,"Take a leisurely walk along the waterfront and visit the Harpa Concert Hall. Enjoy traditional Icelandic cuisine at a local restaurant and prepare for your Northern Lights adventure.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Harpa+Reykjavík",Walk,false,,Input Number,2,"Golden Circle Tour",,"Embark on the famous Golden Circle route. Visit Thingvellir National Park, witness the powerful Gullfoss waterfall, and see the erupting Geysir hot spring. End the day at the Blue Lagoon for a relaxing soak.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Gullfoss+Waterfall",Car,true,,,"Blue Lagoon Experience",,"Relax in the geothermal waters of the Blue Lagoon, one of Iceland's most famous attractions. The mineral-rich waters are perfect for unwinding after a day of sightseeing.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Blue+Lagoon+Iceland",Car,true,,Input Number,3,"Northern Lights Hunt",,"Take a guided Northern Lights tour in the evening. Your expert guide will take you to the best viewing spots away from city lights. Learn about the science behind the Aurora Borealis while enjoying hot chocolate and traditional Icelandic snacks.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Reykjavík+Northern+Lights+Tour",Bus,true,,,"Glacier Adventure",,"Experience a thrilling glacier hike on Sólheimajökull glacier. Learn about Iceland's glacial formations and climate change impacts. Afternoon visit to Reynisfjara black sand beach with its dramatic basalt columns.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Sólheimajökull+Glacier",Car,true,,Input Number,4,"Departure Day",,"Enjoy a final breakfast in Reykjavík and visit the National Museum of Iceland to learn about the country's Viking heritage. Transfer to the airport for your departure flight.","https://maps.google.com/?q=National+Museum+Iceland",Walk,false,,,"Final Souvenirs",,"Pick up some traditional Icelandic souvenirs like wool sweaters, lava salt, or Icelandic chocolate before heading to the airport.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Reykjavík+Souvenirs",Walk,false,
public,"Moroccan Desert Odyssey",,"Morocco","Marrakech-Safi","Marrakech","Cultural,Adventure",1800,"USD",false,"Journey through Morocco's diverse landscapes from bustling souks to endless desert dunes. Experience Berber culture, camel trekking, and nights under the stars in luxury desert camps.",,Input Number,1,"Arrival in Marrakech",,"Arrive in Marrakech and check into your riad in the medina. Explore the vibrant Jemaa el-Fnaa square with its snake charmers, storytellers, and food stalls. Visit the Bahia Palace and enjoy a traditional tagine dinner.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Jemaa+el-Fnaa+Marrakech",Walk,false,,,"Medina Exploration",,"Wander through the narrow alleys of the medina, discovering hidden courtyards and artisan workshops. Visit the Koutoubia Mosque and enjoy mint tea at a traditional café.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Koutoubia+Mosque+Marrakech",Walk,false,,Input Number,2,"Atlas Mountains & Berber Villages",,"Drive through the Atlas Mountains to visit traditional Berber villages. Meet local families, learn about their way of life, and enjoy mint tea in a mountain home. Hike to waterfalls and enjoy panoramic mountain views.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Atlas+Mountains+Morocco",Car,true,,,"Traditional Lunch",,"Enjoy a traditional Berber lunch in a mountain village. Taste authentic couscous, tagines, and fresh bread while learning about local customs and traditions.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Berber+Village+Morocco",Car,true,,Input Number,3,"Desert Journey Begins",,"Travel to Merzouga and prepare for your desert adventure. Take a camel trek into the Erg Chebbi dunes as the sun sets. Arrive at your luxury desert camp for dinner and traditional Berber music under the stars.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Erg+Chebbi+Dunes",Camel,true,,,"Desert Camp Experience",,"Spend the night in a luxury desert camp with comfortable tents and modern amenities. Enjoy traditional Berber music and storytelling around the campfire under a star-filled sky.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Merzouga+Desert+Camp",Camel,true,,Input Number,4,"Desert Sunrise & Return",,"Wake up early to watch the sunrise over the dunes. Enjoy breakfast at the camp before camel trekking back to Merzouga. Visit a local nomad family and learn about desert survival techniques.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Merzouga+Morocco",Camel,true,,,"Return to Marrakech",,"Drive back to Marrakech through the dramatic High Atlas Mountains. Stop at Aït Ben Haddou, a UNESCO World Heritage site and famous filming location.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Aït+Ben+Haddou+Morocco",Car,true,
public,"New Zealand South Island Explorer",,"New Zealand","South Island","Queenstown","Nature,Adventure",3200,"NZD",false,"Discover New Zealand's South Island with its dramatic fjords, pristine lakes, and adventure capital Queenstown. Experience bungee jumping, Milford Sound cruises, and world-class hiking trails.",,Input Number,1,"Arrival in Queenstown",,"Arrive in Queenstown, the adventure capital of New Zealand. Check into your lakeside hotel and take the Skyline Gondola for panoramic views of Lake Wakatipu. Enjoy dinner at a local restaurant with views of The Remarkables mountain range.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Queenstown+Skyline+Gondola",Walk,false,,,"Lake Wakatipu Walk",,"Take a leisurely walk along the shores of Lake Wakatipu. Visit the Queenstown Gardens and enjoy the stunning mountain scenery. Stop for coffee at a lakeside café.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Lake+Wakatipu+Queenstown",Walk,false,,Input Number,2,"Milford Sound Adventure",,"Take a scenic drive through Fiordland National Park to Milford Sound. Board a cruise ship to explore the dramatic fjord with its towering cliffs and waterfalls. Look for dolphins, seals, and penguins in their natural habitat.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Milford+Sound+New+Zealand",Car,true,,,"Fiordland National Park",,"Explore the pristine wilderness of Fiordland National Park. Take short walks to view waterfalls and learn about the unique ecosystem of this UNESCO World Heritage site.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Fiordland+National+Park",Car,true,,Input Number,3,"Adventure Activities",,"Experience Queenstown's famous adventure activities. Choose from bungee jumping at Kawarau Gorge Bridge, jet boating on the Shotover River, or paragliding over Lake Wakatipu. Afternoon wine tasting at local vineyards.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Kawarau+Gorge+Bridge",Car,true,,,"Wine Tasting",,"Visit local Central Otago wineries and taste world-class Pinot Noir wines. Learn about the unique terroir of the region and enjoy cheese pairings with your wine tastings.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Central+Otago+Wineries",Car,true,,Input Number,4,"Routeburn Track Hike",,"Embark on a day hike along the famous Routeburn Track. Walk through ancient beech forests, alpine meadows, and enjoy stunning views of the Southern Alps. Pack a picnic lunch to enjoy at Key Summit.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Routeburn+Track+New+Zealand",Walk,true,,,"Departure Preparation",,"Return to Queenstown and prepare for departure. Visit local shops for souvenirs and enjoy a final dinner overlooking Lake Wakatipu.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Queenstown+Shopping",Walk,false,
public,"Vietnam Food & Culture Journey",,"Vietnam","Ho Chi Minh City","Ho Chi Minh City","Cultural,Food",1200,"USD",false,"Immerse yourself in Vietnam's rich culinary traditions and cultural heritage. From street food tours in Ho Chi Minh City to cooking classes in Hoi An, discover the authentic flavors of Vietnamese cuisine.",,Input Number,1,"Arrival in Ho Chi Minh City",,"Arrive in Ho Chi Minh City and check into your hotel in District 1. Explore the historic Reunification Palace and War Remnants Museum. Evening street food tour through Ben Thanh Market and surrounding alleys.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Ben+Thanh+Market+Ho+Chi+Minh",Walk,false,,,"Street Food Adventure",,"Sample authentic Vietnamese street food including pho, banh mi, and fresh spring rolls. Learn about local ingredients and cooking techniques from street vendors.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Ho+Chi+Minh+Street+Food",Walk,false,,Input Number,2,"Mekong Delta Day Trip",,"Take a day trip to the Mekong Delta. Cruise along narrow canals, visit floating markets, and learn about local life. Enjoy fresh tropical fruits and traditional Vietnamese lunch at a local family's home.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Mekong+Delta+Vietnam",Boat,true,,,"Floating Market Experience",,"Visit the famous Cai Rang floating market where vendors sell goods from their boats. Taste fresh coconuts and tropical fruits while experiencing traditional Vietnamese commerce.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Cai+Rang+Floating+Market",Boat,true,,Input Number,3,"Cooking Class & Cu Chi Tunnels",,"Morning cooking class to learn traditional Vietnamese recipes. Afternoon visit to the Cu Chi Tunnels to learn about Vietnam's wartime history. Evening food tour through District 3's hidden street food gems.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Cu+Chi+Tunnels+Vietnam",Car,true,,,"Traditional Cooking",,"Learn to cook authentic Vietnamese dishes like pho, spring rolls, and Vietnamese pancakes. Visit a local market to select fresh ingredients and enjoy your culinary creations.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Vietnamese+Cooking+Class+Ho+Chi+Minh",Walk,true,,Input Number,4,"Flight to Hoi An",,"Fly to Da Nang and transfer to Hoi An. Explore the ancient town's lantern-lit streets and Japanese Covered Bridge. Visit local artisans and enjoy a traditional Vietnamese dinner by the Thu Bon River.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Hoi+An+Ancient+Town",Walk,false,,,"Lantern Making Workshop",,"Participate in a traditional lantern making workshop. Learn about the craft from local artisans and create your own beautiful silk lantern to take home as a souvenir.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Hoi+An+Lantern+Workshop",Walk,false,
public,"Peruvian Andes & Amazon Adventure",,"Peru","Cusco","Cusco","Cultural,Nature,Adventure",2800,"USD",false,"Explore Peru's diverse landscapes from the ancient Inca capital of Cusco to the Amazon rainforest. Visit Machu Picchu, hike the Sacred Valley, and discover incredible biodiversity in the Amazon basin.",,Input Number,1,"Arrival in Cusco",,"Arrive in Cusco and acclimatize to the high altitude. Explore the historic city center with its colonial architecture and Inca foundations. Visit the Cathedral and San Pedro Market. Light dinner and early rest to prevent altitude sickness.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Cusco+Cathedral+Peru",Walk,false,,,"San Pedro Market",,"Explore the vibrant San Pedro Market where locals shop for fresh produce, traditional foods, and handicrafts. Sample local fruits and learn about Peruvian ingredients.","https://maps.google.com/?q=San+Pedro+Market+Cusco",Walk,false,,Input Number,2,"Sacred Valley Tour",,"Explore the Sacred Valley with visits to Pisac market, Ollantaytambo fortress, and Moray agricultural terraces. Learn about Inca engineering and agricultural techniques. Overnight in Ollantaytambo to prepare for Machu Picchu.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Pisac+Market+Peru",Car,true,,,"Ollantaytambo Fortress",,"Visit the impressive Ollantaytambo fortress, one of the best-preserved Inca sites. Learn about Inca military architecture and enjoy panoramic views of the Sacred Valley.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Ollantaytambo+Fortress+Peru",Car,true,,Input Number,3,"Machu Picchu Discovery",,"Early morning train to Aguas Calientes and bus to Machu Picchu. Guided tour of the ancient Inca citadel with its temples, terraces, and astronomical observatory. Afternoon hike to Huayna Picchu for panoramic views.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Machu+Picchu+Peru",Train,true,,,"Huayna Picchu Hike",,"Challenge yourself with the steep hike to Huayna Picchu peak for breathtaking views of Machu Picchu and the surrounding mountains. This iconic hike offers unparalleled photo opportunities.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Huayna+Picchu+Peru",Walk,true,,Input Number,4,"Amazon Rainforest",,"Fly to Puerto Maldonado and boat transfer to your Amazon lodge. Afternoon jungle walk to spot wildlife including monkeys, birds, and insects. Evening night walk to discover nocturnal creatures and bioluminescent fungi.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Puerto+Maldonado+Peru",Boat,true,,,"Jungle Night Walk",,"Experience the Amazon rainforest at night with a guided walk to spot nocturnal animals, insects, and bioluminescent fungi. Learn about the unique ecosystem of the rainforest.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Amazon+Rainforest+Peru",Walk,true,
public,"Scottish Highlands & Whisky Trail",,"Scotland","Highlands","Edinburgh","Cultural,Nature",2200,"GBP",false,"Discover Scotland's dramatic Highlands, ancient castles, and world-famous whisky distilleries. From Edinburgh's Royal Mile to the Isle of Skye, experience Scotland's rich history and stunning natural beauty.",,Input Number,1,"Arrival in Edinburgh",,"Arrive in Edinburgh and explore the historic Royal Mile. Visit Edinburgh Castle and the Palace of Holyroodhouse. Evening whisky tasting at a traditional Scottish pub with live folk music.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Edinburgh+Castle+Scotland",Walk,false,,,"Royal Mile Exploration",,"Walk along the historic Royal Mile connecting Edinburgh Castle to Holyrood Palace. Visit St. Giles' Cathedral and explore the narrow closes (alleys) filled with history and character.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Royal+Mile+Edinburgh",Walk,false,,Input Number,2,"Highland Journey Begins",,"Drive through the Highlands to Stirling Castle and the Wallace Monument. Continue to Glencoe for dramatic mountain scenery and hiking. Overnight in Fort William with views of Ben Nevis.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Glencoe+Scotland",Car,true,,,"Stirling Castle Visit",,"Explore Stirling Castle, one of Scotland's most important historical sites. Learn about Mary Queen of Scots and enjoy panoramic views of the surrounding countryside.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Stirling+Castle+Scotland",Car,true,,Input Number,3,"Isle of Skye Adventure",,"Take the ferry to the Isle of Skye and explore the Fairy Pools, Old Man of Storr, and Quiraing. Visit Dunvegan Castle and learn about the MacLeod clan history. Evening seafood dinner in Portree.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Fairy+Pools+Isle+of+Skye",Ferry,true,,,"Dunvegan Castle",,"Visit Dunvegan Castle, the ancestral home of the MacLeod clan. Explore the castle grounds and learn about Scottish clan history and traditions.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Dunvegan+Castle+Skye",Car,true,,Input Number,4,"Whisky Distillery Tour",,"Visit Talisker Distillery for a guided tour and tasting. Learn about the whisky-making process and Skye's unique terroir. Afternoon drive through the Highlands with stops at scenic viewpoints and ancient standing stones.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Talisker+Distillery+Skye",Car,true,,,"Highland Scenic Drive",,"Drive through the dramatic Highland landscapes with stops at scenic viewpoints. Visit ancient standing stones and learn about Scotland's prehistoric heritage.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Scottish+Highlands+Standing+Stones",Car,true,
public,"Jordan Petra & Wadi Rum Expedition",,"Jordan","Ma'an","Petra","Cultural,Adventure,Historical",1900,"JOD",false,"Explore Jordan's ancient wonders from the rose-red city of Petra to the Martian landscapes of Wadi Rum. Experience Bedouin culture, camel trekking, and stargazing in one of the world's darkest skies.",,Input Number,1,"Arrival in Amman",,"Arrive in Amman and explore the ancient Citadel and Roman Amphitheater. Visit the Jordan Museum to learn about the country's rich history. Evening food tour through downtown Amman's traditional restaurants.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Amman+Citadel+Jordan",Walk,false,,,"Roman Amphitheater",,"Visit the impressive Roman Amphitheater in downtown Amman. Learn about Jordan's Roman heritage and enjoy panoramic views of the city from the top tiers.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Roman+Amphitheater+Amman",Walk,false,,Input Number,2,"Journey to Petra",,"Drive to Petra through the dramatic Jordanian desert. Arrive at the ancient Nabatean city and walk through the Siq to reach the Treasury. Explore the Royal Tombs and Monastery with a local Bedouin guide.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Petra+Jordan",Car,true,,,"Petra Monastery Hike",,"Hike up to the Monastery (Ad Deir) for stunning views and fewer crowds. This challenging hike rewards you with one of Petra's most impressive monuments and panoramic desert views.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Petra+Monastery+Jordan",Walk,true,,Input Number,3,"Wadi Rum Desert Camp",,"Transfer to Wadi Rum and meet your Bedouin hosts. Take a 4x4 jeep tour through the desert's red sand dunes and rock formations. Evening traditional Bedouin dinner and stargazing session.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Wadi+Rum+Jordan",Jeep,true,,,"Bedouin Culture Experience",,"Learn about traditional Bedouin culture and customs. Enjoy traditional music and storytelling around the campfire under the spectacular desert night sky.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Wadi+Rum+Bedouin+Camp",Jeep,true,,Input Number,4,"Dead Sea Experience",,"Drive to the Dead Sea for a unique floating experience in the hypersaline water. Visit Mount Nebo where Moses viewed the Promised Land. Relax at a Dead Sea resort with mud treatments and spa services.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Dead+Sea+Jordan",Car,true,,,"Mount Nebo Visit",,"Visit Mount Nebo where Moses is said to have viewed the Promised Land. Enjoy panoramic views of the Jordan Valley and learn about the biblical significance of this sacred site.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Mount+Nebo+Jordan",Car,true,
public,"Canadian Rockies & Wildlife Safari",,"Canada","Alberta","Banff","Nature,Adventure",2600,"CAD",false,"Discover the pristine wilderness of the Canadian Rockies with its turquoise lakes, towering peaks, and abundant wildlife. Experience world-class hiking, wildlife viewing, and the famous Icefields Parkway scenic drive.",,Input Number,1,"Arrival in Calgary",,"Arrive in Calgary and drive to Banff National Park. Check into your mountain lodge and explore the charming town of Banff. Visit the Banff Gondola for panoramic views of the Rockies. Evening dinner at a local mountain restaurant.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Banff+Gondola+Canada",Car,false,,,"Banff Town Exploration",,"Explore the charming mountain town of Banff. Visit local shops, art galleries, and enjoy coffee at a cozy café. Take in the stunning mountain scenery that surrounds the town.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Banff+Town+Canada",Walk,false,,Input Number,2,"Lake Louise & Moraine Lake",,"Early morning visit to Lake Louise for the famous turquoise waters and Victoria Glacier views. Hike to the Lake Agnes Tea House for traditional mountain hospitality. Afternoon at Moraine Lake with its stunning Valley of the Ten Peaks.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Lake+Louise+Canada",Car,true,,,"Moraine Lake Photography",,"Capture the iconic beauty of Moraine Lake with its turquoise waters and dramatic mountain backdrop. This is one of the most photographed locations in the Canadian Rockies.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Moraine+Lake+Canada",Car,true,,Input Number,3,"Icefields Parkway Adventure",,"Drive the spectacular Icefields Parkway to Jasper National Park. Stop at Peyto Lake, Columbia Icefield, and Athabasca Falls. Take the Ice Explorer onto the Athabasca Glacier for a unique glacier experience.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Columbia+Icefield+Canada",Car,true,,,"Athabasca Falls",,"Visit the powerful Athabasca Falls and learn about the geological forces that shaped the Canadian Rockies. Take short walks to various viewpoints for different perspectives of the falls.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Athabasca+Falls+Canada",Car,true,,Input Number,4,"Wildlife Safari & Hot Springs",,"Morning wildlife safari to spot bears, elk, and mountain goats. Afternoon visit to Banff Upper Hot Springs for relaxation with mountain views. Evening stargazing session in the dark sky preserve.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Banff+Upper+Hot+Springs",Car,true,,,"Wildlife Viewing",,"Join a guided wildlife safari to spot bears, elk, moose, and other Canadian Rockies wildlife. Learn about animal behavior and conservation efforts in the national park.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Banff+Wildlife+Safari",Car,true,
public,"Greek Islands & Ancient History",,"Greece","Aegean","Santorini","Cultural,Beach,Historical",2100,"EUR",false,"Explore Greece's ancient history and stunning island beauty. From Athens' Acropolis to Santorini's volcanic landscapes and Mykonos' vibrant nightlife, experience the best of Greek culture and Mediterranean charm.",,Input Number,1,"Arrival in Athens",,"Arrive in Athens and explore the ancient Acropolis and Parthenon. Visit the Acropolis Museum and walk through the historic Plaka neighborhood. Evening dinner at a traditional taverna with live Greek music.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Acropolis+Athens+Greece",Walk,false,,,"Plaka Neighborhood",,"Explore the charming Plaka neighborhood with its narrow streets, traditional houses, and local shops. Visit the Ancient Agora and enjoy coffee at a traditional Greek café.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Plaka+Athens+Greece",Walk,false,,Input Number,2,"Ferry to Santorini",,"Take the ferry to Santorini and check into your cliffside hotel in Oia. Explore the famous blue-domed churches and white-washed buildings. Sunset dinner with views of the caldera and volcanic islands.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Oia+Santorini+Greece",Ferry,false,,,"Santorini Sunset",,"Experience the world-famous Santorini sunset from Oia. Find a perfect spot to watch the sun sink into the Aegean Sea while enjoying local wine and traditional Greek appetizers.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Santorini+Sunset+Oia",Walk,false,,Input Number,3,"Santorini Wine Tour",,"Visit local wineries and learn about Santorini's unique volcanic terroir. Taste Assyrtiko wines and enjoy lunch at a traditional vineyard. Afternoon beach time at Red Beach or Kamari Beach.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Santorini+Wineries+Greece",Car,true,,,"Red Beach Visit",,"Visit the unique Red Beach with its dramatic red volcanic cliffs and crystal-clear waters. This is one of Santorini's most distinctive and photogenic beaches.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Red+Beach+Santorini",Car,true,,Input Number,4,"Mykonos Adventure",,"Ferry to Mykonos and explore the charming Mykonos Town with its windmills and Little Venice. Visit Delos Island for ancient Greek ruins. Evening experience Mykonos' famous nightlife and beach clubs.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Mykonos+Town+Greece",Ferry,false,,,"Delos Island Excursion",,"Take a boat trip to Delos Island, the birthplace of Apollo and Artemis. Explore the extensive archaeological site with its ancient temples, mosaics, and theater.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Delos+Island+Greece",Boat,true,
public,"Patagonia Wilderness Expedition",,"Argentina","Santa Cruz","El Calafate","Nature,Adventure",3500,"USD",false,"Discover the raw beauty of Patagonia with its massive glaciers, pristine lakes, and dramatic mountain landscapes. Experience glacier trekking, wildlife viewing, and the famous Perito Moreno Glacier calving phenomenon.",,Input Number,1,"Arrival in El Calafate",,"Arrive in El Calafate and check into your lakeside hotel. Explore the town and visit the Glaciarium Museum to learn about Patagonia's glacial history. Evening dinner with local Patagonian lamb specialties.","https://maps.google.com/?q=El+Calafate+Argentina",Walk,false,,,"Glaciarium Museum",,"Visit the Glaciarium Museum to learn about Patagonia's glaciers, climate change, and the region's unique ecosystem. Interactive exhibits provide fascinating insights into glacial science.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Glaciarium+Museum+El+Calafate",Walk,false,,Input Number,2,"Perito Moreno Glacier",,"Full day at Perito Moreno Glacier, one of the world's most spectacular natural wonders. Walk the viewing platforms and witness massive ice calving events. Optional glacier trekking with crampons and ice axes.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Perito+Moreno+Glacier+Argentina",Car,true,,,"Glacier Trekking",,"Experience the thrill of walking on the Perito Moreno Glacier with professional guides. Learn about glacial formation and witness the incredible blue ice formations up close.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Perito+Moreno+Glacier+Trekking",Walk,true,,Input Number,3,"El Chaltén Hiking",,"Drive to El Chaltén, Argentina's hiking capital. Trek to Laguna Torre for views of Cerro Torre and the glacier. Afternoon hike to Mirador de los Cóndores for panoramic mountain vistas.","https://maps.google.com/?q=El+Chaltén+Argentina",Car,true,,,"Laguna Torre Hike",,"Hike to Laguna Torre for stunning views of Cerro Torre peak and its glacier. This challenging hike rewards you with some of Patagonia's most iconic mountain scenery.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Laguna+Torre+El+Chaltén",Walk,true,,Input Number,4,"Estancia Experience",,"Visit a traditional Patagonian estancia (ranch) to learn about gaucho culture and sheep farming. Enjoy an asado (barbecue) lunch and horseback riding through the Patagonian steppe. Evening stargazing in the pristine wilderness.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Patagonian+Estancia+Argentina",Car,true,,,"Gaucho Culture",,"Learn about traditional gaucho culture and sheep farming in Patagonia. Watch sheep shearing demonstrations and learn about the region's agricultural heritage.","https://maps.google.com/?q=Gaucho+Culture+Patagonia",Horseback,true,